    <guid isPermaLink="false">64170de773768bea35daa25f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Mar 2023 13:28:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春光明媚，玉兰花开啦~想出走的心也愈发强烈，我们注意到最近很多喜欢的歌手官宣了演出计划，livehouse 的门票也都一票难求。本期我们一起聊了聊有关音乐现场，演唱会的记忆，让我们和音乐一起，漫步春天~</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听指南：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 野孩子乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 周华健和纵贯线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 东方神起,TANK,SHE</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 张守望,草东没有派对,刺猬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 五月天</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期精选歌单：</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Riders on the Storm-大门乐队</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>黄河谣-野孩子</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>少年-周华健</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>火车驶向云外，梦安魂于九霄-刺猬乐队</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>突然好想你-五月天</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>O-正 反 合-东方神起</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Some one like you -阿黛尔</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>主播：哈哈，事儿，头子，小白，鹿仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑兼音乐总监：头子</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：哈哈</span></p>]]></description>
